### name: dec.int128-min.abs-positive
--- note
The product -2^63 * 2^64 is exactly -2^127, the C++ int128 minimum; negating or taking abs of that mantissa was UB (CPP-C41). Variables keep the literals from folding.
--- setup
A = -9223372036854775808; B = 18446744073709551616; C = A * B
--- source
ABS(C) > 0
--- expect
bool TRUE
===

